# ── LinkedIn ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for publishing posts to LinkedIn.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Create a LinkedIn Developer App at https://www.linkedin.com/developers/
# 2. Add the "Share on LinkedIn" product (gives w_member_social permission)
# 3. Generate an access token (valid for 60 days — refresh periodically)
# 4. Find your Person URN: GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/me
#
LINKEDIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_linkedin_access_token_here
LINKEDIN_PERSON_URN=urn:li:person:your_id_here

# ── NOT NEEDED IN CASE B ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Notion  → handled via Notion MCP (no API key needed)
# Research → handled via Claude Code's built-in WebSearch tool
# Claude  → Claude Code IS the model (no Anthropic API key needed)
#
# If you want to run Case A (python main.py), create a separate .env.case-a with:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, TAVILY_API_KEY, NOTION_API_KEY, NOTION_DATABASE_ID
